  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;div&gt;The proposed development, by reason of scale, siting, design, bulk, mass and appearance would be an undesirable addition to the dwelling. The side extension would create a staggered roof form that is inconsistent with the existing character of the semi-detached dwelling, significantly impacting the dwellings symmetry.&amp;nbsp; The side extension would be significantly visible from public vantage points and would be visually intrusive, represent poor design and would disrupt the existing pattern of development.&amp;nbsp; As such, the proposed development is contrary to:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10.5pt;&quot;&gt;- National Planning Policy Framework&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;National Planning Policy Framework (NPPF) (MHCLG, 2024)&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 14.98px;&quot;&gt;- Policy D4 of the London Plan (March 2021)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 14.98px;&quot;&gt;- The Residential Extensions and Alterations Supplementary Planning Document (February 2012)&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10.5pt;&quot;&gt;- Policies SP2, DMD1 and DMD5 of&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;The London Borough of Barking and Dagenham’s Local Plan 2037: (September 2024)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;"
